00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:39.800
But how do we go
about doing this?

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.860
We call this a very simple
three-step process, right?

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:46.435
Step one is we migrate
the application as is.

00:04:46.435 --> 00:04:48.560
And this is where I'm going
to say that it's a lift

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.440
and modernize, not
a lift and shift.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.415
Because we're taking
the application and we

00:04:52.415 --> 00:04:54.260
