them to containers.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:57.000
And the business benefit is
immediately in that first step.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.672
You're able to see that 37% TCO
savings right out of the box.

00:05:00.672 --> 00:05:02.255
Now that you have
this as a container,

00:05:02.255 --> 00:05:04.380
you can actually connect
it to an automated testing

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:07.020
and deployment to a [INAUDIBLE]
process or whatever.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:09.840
And then at your leisure, you
can refactor and [INAUDIBLE]

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:10.350
form.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:15.270
And as a combination, you can
see an extra 78% TCO savings.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:17.030
So let's start
